{"4119160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "An Easter to Remember", "steam_appid": 4119160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>AFTER TODAY, YOU’RE NEVER GOING TO FORGET THIS EASTER…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAKING NEWS:</strong> <i>A man in a rabbit costume has broken into a local middle school and is attacking students, teachers, and staff with a chainsaw. Authorities have surrounded the building and are attempting to enter without risking further casualties.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the kids trapped inside during the lockdown. The front doors are barricaded, so your only options are escape or death. Stay quiet and move carefully, watch every corner as a direct encounter with the killer could mean certain death… or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE LONG ENOUGH TO ESCAPE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense, and terrifying experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear and tension are guaranteed from start to finish. There’s never a moment of rest, it’s a race against time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely defenseless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or die, those are your only options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll never know what to expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Killer Rabbit is cunning, he’ll always find a way to catch you by surprise when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Easter won’t end in a day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability that keeps you coming back for more, featuring random events in every match, Game Modes, and Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the Scares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Multiplayer with your friends and try escaping together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>AFTER TODAY, YOU’RE NEVER GOING TO FORGET THIS EASTER…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAKING NEWS:</strong> <i>A man in a rabbit costume has broken into a local middle school and is attacking students, teachers, and staff with a chainsaw. Authorities have surrounded the building and are attempting to enter without risking further casualties.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the kids trapped inside during the lockdown. The front doors are barricaded, so your only options are escape or death. Stay quiet and move carefully, watch every corner as a direct encounter with the killer could mean certain death… or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE LONG ENOUGH TO ESCAPE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense, and terrifying experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear and tension are guaranteed from start to finish. There’s never a moment of rest, it’s a race against time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely defenseless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or die, those are your only options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll never know what to expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Killer Rabbit is cunning, he’ll always find a way to catch you by surprise when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Easter won’t end in a day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability that keeps you coming back for more, featuring random events in every match, Game Modes, and Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the Scares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Multiplayer with your friends and try escaping together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.poster.avif?t=1777433150\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.webm?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.mp4?t=1777433150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You're trapped in your school during a lockdown and being hunted by a chainsaw-wielding maniac in an Easter Bunny suit. Get ready to experience an unforgettable Easter…", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil<stro